-iMac-M4-hero-feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-iMac-M4-hero-feature\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17148,\"date\":\"2026-08-24T08:00:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-24T06:00:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"iphone-ultra-test-iniziali-enthusiasmanti-nota-stonata-fotocamera\",\"title\":\"iPhone Ultra, test iniziali entusiasmanti: l’unica nota stonata è la fotocamera\",\"excerpt\":\"I primi test su iPhone Ultra avrebbero colpito i tester per prestazioni e esperienza complessiva, ma emergerebbe una criticità: la fotocamera.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/Foldable-iPhone-2023-Feature-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Foldable-iPhone-2023-Feature-1\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17145,\"date\":\"2026-08-23T20:50:15+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-23T18:50:15+00:00\",\"slug\":\"mercato-smartphone-rallenta-apple-cresce-iphone-17\",\"title\":\"Il mercato smartphone rallenta quasi ovunque, ma Apple continua a crescere\",\"excerpt\":\"Le vendite di smartphone calano in gran parte del mondo, mentre Apple guadagna terreno grazie alla forte domanda per iPhone 17.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/08/iPhone-17-Pro-Air-Box-768x660.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iPhone-17-Pro-Air-Box\",\"authorName\":\"\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"\",\"authorSlug\":\"\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":17141,\"date\":\"2026-08-23T08:22:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-08-23T06:22:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-vision-pro-nome-reality-pro-quasi-definitivo\",\"title\":\"Apple Vision Pro: il nome “Reality Pro” era quasi quello definitivo\",\"exc